+Arcvera-Core 1.0.1 uses official Codex 0.167.0 helper resources. Pass the upstream version separately and supply all three built candidates from one frozen commit:
 
 ```text
-python package_cli.py --source CHECKOUT --freeze source-freeze.json --binary BUILT_CODEX_EXE --vendor OFFICIAL_VENDOR_DIRECTORY --output NEW_DIRECTORY --version PATCHED_VERSION
